---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl my-10 md:my-14 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                Regulatory Approvals & Clearances
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                We ensure that every industrial park meets all legal, statutory, and regulatory requirements. Our team handles a full spectrum of approvals and clearances to guarantee that your business operations start smoothly and remain risk-free.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/location.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Land Use & Zoning Approvals
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Ensuring industrial land is compliant with local master plans and government zoning regulations.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/recycled-paper.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Environmental Clearances
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Full compliance with pollution control, waste management, and sustainable development norms. 
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/crane.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Building & Construction Permits
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Adhering to building codes, fire safety regulations, and structural safety standards.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/certificate.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Occupancy Certificates
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Obtaining all legal permissions for operational readiness.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/compliance.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Utility Approvals
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Secure electricity, water, sewage, and drainage connections for uninterrupted operations.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/labor-safety.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Labour & Safety Compliance
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Ensuring worker safety, labor law adherence, and emergency preparedness.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/fire-sign.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Fire & Emergency NOCs
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Complete fire safety audits, infrastructure, and evacuation clearances.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
                <div class="w-full flex justify-start pb-2.5 md:4 lg:5 relative after:absolute after:w-full after:h-[0.5px] after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:bg-gray-200">
                    <Image src="/icons/computer.gif" alt="icon" width={60} height={60} class="w-6 md:w-8 lg:w-10 xl:w-12" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-start pt-1">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium pb-0.5 lg:pb-1 text-[#004EA1]">
                        Ongoing Statutory Monitoring
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500">
                        Continuous tracking of renewals, compliance reporting, and legal updates to prevent delays or risks.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>
